{%- comment -%}
  Image card for a collection — used for the signature houses on the brands hub,
  the sibling-collection rows on collection pages, and the brand strips on the
  product page.

  Image order:
    1. the collection's hero banner, phone variant <handle>-hero-sm.webp,
       which at 1200px still covers a card twice over at a fraction of the weight
    2. an image set on the collection in the admin
    3. its first product photo
    4. a monogram

  Liquid cannot test whether a theme asset exists, so the banner is attempted and
  an onerror hands off to the next option. 89 of 90 collections have one, and the
  handoff costs a request only in the rare case where one does not.

  Usage:
    {% render 'collection-card', collection: some_collection %}
    {% render 'collection-card', collection: some_collection, label: 'Office Wear Perfumes', cta: 'Shop the house' %}
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign card_label = label | default: collection.title
  assign card_cta = cta | default: 'Browse'
  assign card_banner = collection.handle | append: '-hero-sm.webp'
  assign card_image = collection.image
  if card_image == blank
    assign card_image = collection.products.first.featured_image
  endif
-%}

<a class="hub-tile coll-tile" href="{{ collection.url }}">
  {%- comment -%} sits underneath, revealed if every image option fails {%- endcomment -%}
  <span class="coll-tile-mark" aria-hidden="true">{{ card_label | slice: 0, 1 }}</span>
  <img src="{{ card_banner | asset_url }}"
       {%- if card_image %} data-fallback="{{ card_image | image_url: width: 600 }}"{% endif %}
       onerror="if(this.dataset.fallback){this.src=this.dataset.fallback;delete this.dataset.fallback}else{this.remove()}"
       alt="{{ card_label | escape }}" loading="lazy" width="1200" height="417">
  <div class="hub-body">
    <h3>{{ card_label }}</h3>
    {%- if collection.products_count > 0 -%}
      <p>{{ collection.products_count }} fragrance{% if collection.products_count != 1 %}s{% endif %}</p>
    {%- endif -%}
    <span class="hub-go">{{ card_cta }} <span class="mi" aria-hidden="true">arrow_forward</span></span>
  </div>
</a>
